                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really wanted to like this game. Constantly taking damage on my turn.. on a turn based game... blegh. Then half the time when I attack the enemies just dodge them and counterattack. No prompt to avoid it, no prompt to help the attacks connect... nothing. Just \"I choose this attack, and get kicked in the face instead. Oh, push this button to get off your back now.\"\n\nLoved these books when I was growing up. Super disappointing.\n\nCome on.",
